'''Mega Satan''' is a [[boss]] that appears in [[Chapter 6]] ({{s|Chest}}, {{s|Dark Room}}), and is the final boss of [[Endings|Ending 16]].

sections.Unlock:
Mega Satan is located behind the Golden Gate at the starting room of the {{s|Chest}} and the {{s|Dark Room}}. To unlock Mega Satan, the following criteria must be fulfilled:

* {{e|???}} or {{e|The Lamb}} must have been defeated once for the Golden Gate to spawn. Once that is done, the achievement "The Angels Await" will appear.

* Reaching the {{s|Dark Room}} to fight The Lamb or Mega Satan without having unlocked {{i|The Negative}} can be achieved by either:
** Taking the trapdoor in a {{r|Black Market}} from {{s|Sheol}} if one shows up.
** Taking the trapdoor in an {{r|I AM ERROR}} room while in {{s|Sheol}}.
** {{dlc|a}} Taking a trapdoor that has a small chance to spawn from pressing a {{g|Reward Plate}} in a {{r|Secret Room}} in {{s|Sheol}} if it shows up.
** {{dlc|a}} Using a {{r|Sacrifice Room}} 12 or more times.

* Once unlocked, the Golden Gate can be opened using one of the following methods:
** Defeating {{e|Uriel}} and {{e|Gabriel}} to obtain {{i|Key Piece 1}} and {{i|Key Piece 2}}, respectively. Collecting both pieces turns them into the Golden Key, which automatically opens the Golden Gate upon entering Chapter 6.
*** The Angels can be summoned by bombing an [[Angel Room|Angel Statue]].
*** {{dlc|a}} {{r|Sacrifice Room}}s summon Uriel and Gabriel after stepping on the spikes for the 9th and 11th time, respectively.
** Using {{i|Dad's Key}} in the starting room.
** {{dlc+|a}} Using a {{p|Get out of Jail Free Card}} in the starting room.{{dlc-}}
** {{dlc+|a+}} Instructing {{i|Mr. ME!}} to unlock the door.{{dlc-}}
** {{dlc+|r}} Using {{i|Sharp Key}} on the door.{{dlc-}}
** {{dlc+|r}} Using a {{p|Soul of Cain}} in the starting room.{{dlc-}}
** {{dlc+|r}} Activating {{i|Cracked Orb}} in the starting room.{{dlc-}}
** {{Dlc+|r}} Wisps generated by {{I|Book of Virtues}} + {{I|Mr. ME!}} opening the door on their own.{{dlc-}}
** {{Dlc+|r}} Wisps generated by Book of Virtues + {{I|Book of Secrets}} when destroyed in the starting room.{{dlc-}}

